<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ foreign debt NZ$75.5 billion at March 31 - SNZ.</title>
<headline>NZ foreign debt NZ$75.5 billion at March 31 - SNZ.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand released the following data on Monday on New Zealand's total foreign debt as at March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>Figures are in billions of NZ dollars, and have been rounded. Figures before revision in brackets.</p>
<p>		March 31, 1997     Dec 31, 1996   March 31, 1996</p>
<p>Total		75.5	     78.2 (79.8)	  72.4</p>
<p>Official govt    20.6	     22.3		   21.9</p>
<p>Other sector     54.8	     55.9 (57.5)	  50.5</p>
<p>Economists forecast the total debt would be at $79.75 billion with $22 billion of government debt and $58 billion of other sector.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
